# head/adult/youth/brow_full: the youth's full brows (girls)
# P2b FACES (wave 2): GENERATED from the adult maps by the FACES spec (the boy = the man's views, the girl = the
# woman's as `when girl replace`); edit the adult maps, then regenerate. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person woman
body youth
role brow full
layer face
anchor head
keys rest
tags mirror-ok

view D key rest origin -3 -8
|bbb....bbb

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -10 -8
|bb

view L key rest origin -4 -8
|bb

view D key rest origin -4 -7 when elf replace
|b......b
|.bb..bb.

view R key rest origin -11 -7 when elf replace
|b.
|.b

view L key rest origin -3 -7 when elf replace
|.b
|b.
